
=== Input ===
  name: "Alice" <string>
  extra: "x" <string>

=== Unexpected key rejected by default ===
  [unexpected_key] extra: Unexpected key 'extra'

=== Input ===
  first_name: "Alice" <string>
  role: "admin" <string>
  internalNote: "ignored by #[Skip]" <string>
  anything: "allowed" <string>

=== AllowExtraKeys ignores unknown fields ===
firstName: Alice
internalNote: null (skipped)
role: admin

=== Dehydrate (Skip omits field, Rename applies) ===
{
    "first_name": "Alice",
    "role": "admin"
}
